  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby\r\npermitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of\r\nthis permission.",
    "Notwithstanding the plans hereby approved, detailed existing and proposed elevations and sections of each of the windows to a scale of 1:10 or 1:20 shall be provided to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority prior to the commencement of the relevant part of the works.&nbsp;",
    "The Sash horns are to be retained on the proposed sash windows.&nbsp;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Site Location and Block Plan entitled Drawing No: PL-01;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proposed Elevations entitled Drawing No: PL-04;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;",
    "The&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;timber\r\nframe profiles and materials to be used in the development hereby permitted and/or any\r\nmaking good, shall match those specified in the approved plans list. Any replacement\r\nwindows shall be of white painted timber and retained as such thereafter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-right:12.5pt;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
